        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBC20, Oval Solid Brass Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its simple design, the Oval Doorbell Button is versatile enough to look great on any home. The Oval Doorbell Button is available in the 8 different finishes so you'll be ale to find the perfect match for your needs. It is made out of solid brass for a quality that will last. It measures 2-3/8 inches high by 1-5/8 inches wide. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBC20-Specifications.gif?v=1704354728\" width=\"577\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBC20 Oval Bell Button Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BBC20 Contemporary Oval Doorbell Button:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
